<head></head>
<body>
<div>
<span style="font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">Hello <span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">{{lead.First Name:default=}},</span></span>
</div> 
<div>
&nbsp;
</div> 
<div> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">I hope your spring semester is off to a wonderful start! I’m reaching out on behalf of Flywire to personally invite you to an exclusive</span><a style="text-decoration: none;" href="https://more.flywire.com/FlywireHosted_EDU_BOSTONCFODinner_December2024_2.RegistrationPage.html"> <strong><u><span style="color: #1155cc; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">roundtable networking dinner</span></u></strong></a><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> for financial leaders on Tuesday, February 11th, focused on “<em>Innovative Approaches to Revenue Generation and Student Affordability</em>.”</span></span></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">&nbsp;</span></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">As a valued Flywire client, your institution has been at the forefront of creating exceptional financial experiences for students and their families. Flywire has had the pleasure of working closely with your student financial services team to deliver results. We believe there’s an opportunity to further connect and share ideas on how you can continue driving value at your institution, specifically from a strategic financial perspective.</span></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">&nbsp;</span></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">This intimate gathering has been curated for a select group of Boston-area higher ed CFOs and senior financial leaders to foster an open dialogue around the key issues impacting our sector.&nbsp;</span></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">&nbsp;</span></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Join us to network with peers and Flywire executives, including </span><strong><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">President and COO Rob Orgel</span></strong><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">—former Head of Apple Pay at Apple, and </span><strong><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">CFO Cosmin Pitigoi</span></strong><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">—a global payments expert who spent nearly 20 years at PayPal. This dinner presents a unique opportunity for you to engage with industry leaders who have been at the helm of transformational change in finance and payments.</span></span></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">&nbsp;</span></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Our conversation will cover:</span></p> 
<ul style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; padding-inline-start: 48px;"> 
<li style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #000000; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 1.38;"><span style="font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><strong><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Aligning Financial Leadership with Institutional Goals:</span></strong><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> The CFO’s role in advancing institutional success and sustainability&nbsp;</span></span></li> 
<li style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #000000; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 1.38;"><span style="font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><strong><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Driving New Revenue Streams:</span></strong><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> Innovative strategies for generating revenue through partnerships and technology</span></span></li> 
<li style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #000000; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 1.38;"><span style="font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><strong><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Supporting Student Affordability:</span></strong><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> How technology helps enable efficiencies from recruitment to retention</span></span></li> 
</ul> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">&nbsp;</span></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><strong><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Event Details:</span></strong></span></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><strong><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Date</span></strong><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">: February 11, 2025</span></span></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><strong><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Time</span></strong><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">: 6:00 PM – 9:00 PM</span></span></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><strong><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Location</span></strong><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">:</span><a style="text-decoration: none;" href="https://www.gordonramsayrestaurants.com/en/us/ramsays-kitchen/locations/boston"> <u><span style="color: #1155cc; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Ramsay's Kitchen</span></u></a><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">&nbsp;</span></span></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">&nbsp;</span></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">We are inviting a small group of respected leaders, and I hope you’ll be able to join us for what promises to be a thought-provoking evening. I would love to have your voice at the table as we shape this important conversation together.</span><strong><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> Please let me know if you can attend by January 31, 2025,</span></strong><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> and if you’d be interested in leading a discussion topic.</span></span></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p> 
<span style="color: #0000ff; font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><a style="color: #1155cc;" href="https://more.flywire.com/FlywireHosted_EDU_BOSTONCFODinner_December2024_2.RegistrationPage.html"><strong>REGISTER NOW</strong></a></span>
</div> 
<div> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">Best regards,&nbsp;</span></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">Allison</span></p> 
</div> 
